    <div class="notes-box" style="margin-top: -6px; margin-bottom: 12px; background-color: #f1f5fd; border-left: 3px solid #0051d5; font-size: 8pt; color: #374151;">
        <strong>Batch Traceability & Investigation Notice:</strong> Batch-level information is provided to support inspection and investigation. Presence of an issue in one inspected package does not by itself establish that all products in the batch are non-compliant. Further verification is subject to the competent authority&#39;s procedures.
